{"t":"Santa Claus","s":"santa-claus-7ab7d","k":"npc","i":"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Warning Icon Red\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"42\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Warning_Icon_Red_1eeb32.png\" width=\"50\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">This article or section is about an event NPC, creature, item, object, outfit or location.</p><br/><p>The information about this NPC, <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creature</a>, item, object, outfit or location is only relevant during a certain event or quest, e.g. only during Christmas.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Do not remove the information on this page because you can't find the NPC/creature/item/object/outfit/location.</p><p style=\"line-height:6pt;font-size:6pt;width:100%;text-align:right;\">discuss</p></div><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Santa Claus</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geographical Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVaries\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearest City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Various</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dwarf</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gift Giver</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221212224449&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Santa_Claus_e45463.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Santa Claus.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Has a house on the Ice Island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>. Between the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Saves</a> of December 12 and 31, he can be found in or near each major town, usually near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>.\n</p><p><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></b>: Underground shops, near <a href=\"#/wiki/Shanar\">Shanar</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32656,31661,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32656, 31661, 8)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></b>: In the Tavern west from boat. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33068,32882,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33068, 32882, 6)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></b>: At the White Wave Cellar, south-west of town. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32315,31839,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32315, 31839, 8)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a></b>: South of town, next to the Tavern. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33235,32482,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33235, 32482, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></b>: Inside the Castle, next to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33192,31814,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33192, 31814, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Farmine\">Farmine</a></b>: In the Tavern west from the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">steamship</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32997,31539,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32997, 31539, 10)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Gray%20Beach\">Gray Beach</a></b>: Inside the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33448,31317,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33448, 31317, 8)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a></b>: Jolly Axeman Tavern. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32637,31884,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32637, 31884, 9)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a></b>: West of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32319,32838,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32319, 32838, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></b>: Grassy area south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32622,32756,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32622, 32756, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a></b>: In the Grand Opera Café, west from <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33612,31898,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33612, 31898, 6)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a></b>: West of <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32245,31143,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32245, 31143, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></b>: At <a href=\"#/wiki/Frodo\">Frodo</a>'s shop, north east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32362,32209,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32362, 32209, 7)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a></b>: Under main <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32914,32078,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32914, 32078, 9)</a><br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></b>: In the Tavern east from <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32809,31249,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32809, 31249, 7)</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Only appears during Christmas time, between the <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Saves</a> of December 12 and 31. Rumours say that if you are nice to him, he will give you a present. The present you receive is random.\nYou might receive:<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\"><img alt=\"Candy Cane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Canes</a> +<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\"><img alt=\"Snowball\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snowball_9fb781.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Snowball\">Snowballs</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\"><img alt=\"Candy Cane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Canes</a> +<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Red Christmas Bundle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Christmas_Bundle_7d6088.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blue Christmas Bundle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Christmas_Bundle_014a6a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Christmas Bundle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Christmas_Bundle_a05e72.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span>1 Christmas Bundle<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\"><img alt=\"Candy Cane\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_Cane_850370.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy%20Cane\">Candy Canes</a> +<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Piggy%20Bank\"><img alt=\"Piggy Bank\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piggy_Bank_6d079f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Piggy%20Bank\">Piggy Bank</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Energy Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Ring_e2e62f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> +<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Dwarven Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dwarven_Ring_67bdd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> +<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ring%20of%20Healing\"><img alt=\"Ring of Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ring_of_Healing_3694d0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Ring%20of%20Healing\">Ring of Healing</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\"><img alt=\"Red Gem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Gem_e1cccd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shiny Stone\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shiny_Stone_541668.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Shiny Stone<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Transcendence%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Transcendence Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Transcendence_Potion_6a5e85.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Transcendence%20Potion\">Transcendence Potion</a> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bullseye%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Bullseye Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bullseye_Potion_64f82d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bullseye%20Potion\">Bullseye Potion</a> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mastermind%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Mastermind Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mastermind_Potion_496d18.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mastermind%20Potion\">Mastermind Potion</a> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Berserk Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Berserk_Potion_e52250.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk%20Potion\">Berserk Potion</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Santa Doll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Santa_Doll_4a821d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Santa Doll<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Doll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Doll_62f1ad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Doll<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\"><img alt=\"Violet Gem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Violet_Gem_d7c444.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\">Violet Gem</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dracoyle%20Statue\"><img alt=\"Dracoyle Statue\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dracoyle_Statue_048d12.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dracoyle%20Statue\">Dracoyle Statue</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stuffed%20Dragon\"><img alt=\"Stuffed Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stuffed_Dragon_1d3e7e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Stuffed%20Dragon\">Stuffed Dragon</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Backpack\"><img alt=\"Moon Backpack\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moon_Backpack_cb65b9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Moon%20Backpack\">Moon Backpack</a>\n</p><p>Presents which are <b>only given to a few lucky players</b>:<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Panda%20Teddy\"><img alt=\"Panda Teddy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Panda_Teddy_28eb61.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Panda%20Teddy\">Panda Teddy</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Teddy Bear\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Teddy_Bear_7fd018.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Teddy Bear<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Santa Teddy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Santa_Teddy_42f73b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Santa Teddy<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Amulet of Loss\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Amulet_of_Loss_ce68af.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Amulet of Loss<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bunnyslippers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunnyslippers_ee3fc0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Bunnyslippers<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Claw\"><img alt=\"Dragon Claw\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Claw_a2185a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Claw\">Dragon Claw</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ball Gown\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ball_Gown_482812.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Ball Gown<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\"><img alt=\"Gold Ingot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Ingot_ad1a7f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Snowman Doll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snowman_Doll_997784.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Snowman Doll<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bear Doll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bear_Doll_fb8f8e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> 1 Bear Doll<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Stone\"><img alt=\"Soul Stone\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Soul_Stone_3e756b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Soul%20Stone\">Soul Stone</a>\n</p><p>Also, if your server successfully finished the Lightbearer event and you helped by lighting all 10 fire basins, you may ask him for a <b>very special present</b>. You will then receive the Blazebringer mount.<br/>\nIn previous years Santa Clauses were controlled by CipSoft employees, and could hurt you if you were foulmouthed. At that time he also gave away a larger variety of items. Back then Knightmare organized races to find Santa Claus, giving a Teddy Bear to the winner. Nowadays he only gives extremely lucky persons on any server the precious Teddy Bear.<br/>\nDuring one year Santa gave better gifts in premium cities, but has since returned to his usual self, giving out random presents in every city.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Santa/Presents </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Santa Claus.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nSanta Claus: Merry Christmas, little <i>Player</i>!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b> or <b>job</b><br/>\nSanta Claus: Ho ho ho! You don't know Santa Claus? Never mind. You may ask me for a <b>present</b>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>present</b><br/>\nSanta Claus: Here is your present! Enjoy!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>present</b><br/>\nSanta Claus: You already got your present! Don't be greedy!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Santa Claus</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>thank you</b><br/>\nSanta Claus: You had a few hard times last year, I know. Considering all that you did well and I'm proud of you.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Santa Claus</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div>